[{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0174","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0174.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0604","title":"WebStore 1.0 购物车 CGI 程序信息泄露漏洞","description":"WebStore 1.0 购物车 CGI 程序 web_store.cgi 存在不正确的配置，可能导致私有信息被未授权用户获取。攻击者可以通过网络远程访问该 CGI 程序，利用配置缺陷读取敏感数据，造成信息泄露。该漏洞影响使用 WebStore 1.0 的在线商店系统，无需身份验证即可触发，攻击条件简单，影响面较广。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0604"],"sources":["cve","nvd"],"published":"1999-04-20T00:00:00Z","updated":"1999-04-20T00:00:00Z","remediation":"检查 WebStore 1.0 的 web_store.cgi 配置文件，确保 CGI 程序运行权限最小化，限制对敏感目录的访问。建议升级到经过安全配置审核的更高版本购物车系统，或在 Web 服务器层面配置访问控制规则，禁止未授权用户直接执行该 CGI 脚本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T08:19:37Z","references":["https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-1999-0604","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=92462991805485&w=2"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0174.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0243","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0243.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0684","title":"惠普 HP-UX Sendmail 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"HP-UX 操作系统自带的 Sendmail 8.8.6 版本存在拒绝服务漏洞。攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的邮件数据或构造异常的 SMTP 请求，触发 Sendmail 进程异常处理，导致服务崩溃或停止响应。该漏洞影响运行 HP-UX 系统且默认安装 Sendmail 8.8.6 版本的服务器，攻击者无需身份验证即可远程发起攻击。成功利用后，邮件服务将不可用，可能导致依赖邮件通信的业务中断。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0684"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-04-19T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","remediation":"安装 HP-UX 官方 Sendmail 补丁 PHNE_17190 或升级 Sendmail 至 8.8.8 及以上版本；若暂无法打补丁，可在 sendmail.cf 中限制监听接口，并通过防火墙屏蔽不可信网段的 25 端口作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0684","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/main/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0684.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/master/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0684.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/main/1999/CVE-1999-0684.json","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/master/plugins/hpux_PHNE_17190.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0243.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1020","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1020.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1244","title":"IPFilter 本地任意文件修改漏洞","description":"IPFilter 3.2.3 至 3.2.10 版本中存在本地符号链接攻击漏洞。当程序将运行结果保存到输出文件时，未对文件路径进行充分的安全检查，具有本地访问权限的攻击者可通过创建恶意符号链接，诱使 IPFilter 将输出内容写入攻击者指定的任意文件，从而实现权限提升或破坏系统文件。该漏洞影响 IPFilter 3.2.3 至 3.2.10 版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。建议升级至不受影响的版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1244"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-04-15T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:01Z","remediation":"升级 IPFilter 至 3.2.11 或更高版本，该版本修复了输出文件保存时的竞态条件问题。如无法升级，确保 ipfilter 的保存输出目录仅允许 root 用户写入，并避免在全局可写目录中使用 ipfilter 保存功能。作为临时缓解，可限制本地用户对 ipfilter 输出文件的写权限。对于存储敏感输出文件的目录，使用 sticky bit 或独立子目录防止符号链接攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/13303","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/2087","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e25ede9c3545efaa8ff0b393e30e48edb07502a8/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1244.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1244","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1fe9b156eeeb72b8f8baa50bbe7bc0d9806e8c64/content/CVE-1999-1244.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c1321b1a6b0cb3a4c18f791e2c8443742c0cb0b0/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1244.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/cdfc8886d71af7ef3bdab3e4db46753ff8af6538/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-4rc3-c847-cjgp/GHSA-4rc3-c847-cjgp.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x88000/87832/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1244.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000609.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--87d96785-0cbc-433d-a944-0025d58a8f33.json","https://github.com/dong-xs/Vul-PAG/blob/7eb3b32094a5270cfd8495366e0e4a7df5a874ce/aspect_prediction/org_pred_diff.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1020.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1085","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1085.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1369","title":"Real Media RealServer 密码明文存储致本地权限提升漏洞","description":"RealNetworks RealServer (rmserver) 6.0.3.353 版本存在敏感信息泄露漏洞。该软件将管理员密码以明文形式存储于全局可读的 rmserver.cfg 配置文件中，导致本地攻击者可通过读取该配置文件获取管理员凭据，进而实现权限提升。该漏洞影响 RealServer 6.0.3.353 及可能更早版本，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。建议用户升级至不受影响的版本或限制配置文件访问权限。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1369"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-04-14T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:17Z","remediation":"将 rmserver.cfg 文件权限改为仅管理员可读写（chmod 600），并升级至 RealServer 7.0 以上版本以启用加密密码存储。同时删除配置文件中明文密码字段，改用环境变量或外部认证方式。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=92411181619110&w=2","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/41de94138b7cf6e858138ec4e79e16fbec611fa4/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1369.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1369","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1369.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3012e5f1cf9bcfe839897275a956236aed334269/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1369.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa37ed0317ce1265b487f92916077b9ccbfe3349/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-22jg-rc3r-96wc/GHSA-22jg-rc3r-96wc.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1369.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153400_153500.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000608.txt","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1085.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0123","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0123.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0446","title":"NetBSD NetBSD VFS 符号链接拒绝服务漏洞","description":"NetBSD 1.3.3 及之前版本的 VFS（虚拟文件系统）存在符号链接处理缺陷，本地攻击者可通过 ln 命令创建异常符号链接触发该漏洞，导致系统拒绝服务。由于 VFS 在处理畸形符号链接时未能正确验证其结构，恶意用户可构造特殊链接使内核进入异常状态，造成系统崩溃或服务不可用。该漏洞影响 NetBSD 1.3.3 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低，利用需本地用户权限。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0446"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-04-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:24Z","remediation":"升级至 NetBSD 1.4 或更高版本，该版本已修复 VFS 中对异常符号链接处理的缺陷。如无法立即升级，可限制非信任用户的本地登录权限，或通过内核安全模块禁止特殊符号链接创建作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/7051"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0123.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0121","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0121.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0444","title":"Microsoft Windows ARP Packet 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows 95/98/NT 3.51/NT 4.0/2000 的 ARP 协议处理存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标主机发送特制的恶意 ARP 数据包，触发系统弹窗或日志填充，每收到一个恶意数据包即弹出消息框，或导致日志文件被大量记录占满磁盘空间，从而造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响多个 Windows 版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0444"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-04-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:24Z","remediation":"受影响系统（Windows 95/98/NT 3.51/NT 4.0/2000）均已停止支持，微软不再发布安全补丁。建议立即升级至 Windows 10/11 等受支持版本；在无法升级的环境中，可在网络边界防火墙或交换机上配置 ARP 报文速率限制和异常检测规则，过滤非信任网段的 ARP 广播包，并部署 IDS/IPS 检测恶意 ARP 流量以缓解拒绝服务攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["https://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=92394891221029&w=2"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0121.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1040","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1040.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1323","title":"Symantec Norton AntiVirus NAVIEG及NAVMSE 明文密码存储漏洞","description":"Norton AntiVirus for Internet Email Gateways (NAVIEG) 1.0.1.7及之前版本、Norton AntiVirus for MS Exchange (NAVMSE) 1.5及之前版本存在加密错误漏洞。该漏洞将管理员密码以明文形式存储在NAVIEG的navieg.ini配置文件和NAVMSE的ModifyPassword注册表项中。具有本地访问权限的攻击者可通过读取这些文件或注册表项直接获取管理员密码，进而接管杀毒软件管理控制台。CVSS评分4.6，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1323"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-04-09T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:11Z","remediation":"建议升级至 NAVIEG 1.0.1.8 及以上版本、NAVMSE 1.6 及以上版本，新版本已改用哈希存储密码。如无法升级，应立即通过 NTFS 权限将 navieg.ini 文件设置为仅允许管理员读取（禁止 Everyone 访问），同时使用 regedt32 将 HKLM\\Software\\Symantec\\NAVMSE\\1.5\\ModifyPassword 注册表项的权限设为仅 Administrators 可访问，并将内置 Web 管理页面的绑定地址限制为 127.0.0.1 以阻断远程访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=92370067416739&w=2","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d3dea9b9f675980a583148876f0551475ad122e1/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1323.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1323","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1323.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3f415771bcfb63723b9c0d3f106f197a1964d0e2/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1323.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f37077e857e7a28bab83d284c23299407fb1af7e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-hwj6-4xgp-2fx7/GHSA-hwj6-4xgp-2fx7.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x85000/84469/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1323.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153400_153500.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/dd9f81e9fd85457bf78c55783cb6a31e9af71d63/1999.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1040.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0800","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0800.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0801","title":"BMC Patrol Agent 远程访问控制绕过漏洞","description":"BMC Patrol 监控代理存在权限许可与访问控制缺陷，远程攻击者可构造并伪造（spoofing）特制数据帧来冒充合法客户端，从而绕过代理的身份认证与访问控制机制，直接与目标代理建立会话并取得其访问权限。该漏洞影响启用了 BMC Patrol 代理的监控系统，攻击者无需有效凭证即可在无需本地访问的情况下实施远程攻击，进而可能读取、操纵监控数据或借此进一步渗透受监控主机，危害等级为严重（CVSS 10.0），需及时升级或加强代理的身份校验与网络隔离。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0801"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-04-09T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:05Z","remediation":"建议升级到 BMC Patrol 修复了帧伪造认证缺陷的版本（3.7 及以上，或向 BMC 索取对应补丁），并启用 agent 间的强身份认证与加密通信。在网络层通过防火墙限制 Patrol agent 端口（默认 TCP 3181/3182）仅允许受信任的管理服务器访问，禁用未加密的明文通信，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/2075.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/13204","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fe807f4098db5a5ad8dcb41a479197724cb9e789/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0801.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0801","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/5cf8ba64f356efe9269b21eca2f657231acd746c/content/CVE-1999-0801.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/57cb981038a97031bd95a35a9b10bbed18ca4725/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0801.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f61040ac78eb76aff0a3a68a8a8a4562940d3711/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-j5m3-c723-5mx6/GHSA-j5m3-c723-5mx6.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0801.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/fd4916152066cf69446b0fbd8f7bb3a97a137e13/1999.tsv","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/134977c5f4ce4f427a914ca161b4f075e34b560b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0801.json","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--22a53bc4-5a17-4e10-a222-f321cfc66659.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0800.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0137","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0137.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0471","title":"Tiny Software Winroute 远程代理服务器未授权访问漏洞","description":"Winroute 远程代理服务器存在未授权访问漏洞，远程攻击者无需任何身份认证即可通过点击代理配置界面中的 \"cancel\" 按钮，绕过认证机制重新配置代理服务器设置。攻击者可利用此漏洞修改代理规则、劫持网络流量或实施中间人攻击。该漏洞影响 Winroute 代理服务，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等，建议用户升级至修复版本或限制对代理管理端口的访问。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0471"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-04-09T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:28Z","remediation":"升级到 WinRoute Pro 3.0 及以上版本，该版本修复了远程代理管理接口的未认证访问问题。如无法升级，应在防火墙规则中限制对代理管理端口（默认 3128）的访问来源，仅允许受信任的管理 IP 地址连接。该产品已停止维护，建议迁移至 Kerio Control 或其他受支持的防火墙产品。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0471"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0137.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0134","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0134.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0470","title":"Novell Netware Remote.NLM 弱加密漏洞","description":"Novell Netware 4.1 及 4.11 版本中 Remote.NLM 组件使用弱加密算法对用户密码进行加密处理，攻击者可通过网络嗅探或截获认证数据包后，利用该弱加密算法的可逆性轻易解密出明文密码，从而获得系统未授权访问权限。该漏洞影响 Novell Netware 4.1/4.11 系统，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0470"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-04-09T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:27Z","remediation":"升级到 Novell NetWare 5.1 及以上版本（SP6 或更高补丁包），其中已使用更强加密算法替代 Remote.NLM 的弱加密。对于已停止支持的版本（NetWare 4.x），建议迁移至 SUSE Linux Enterprise Server 或 Micro Focus Open Enterprise Server 等现代平台，并禁用未加密的远程管理服务（如 Remote.NLM）以降低风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/482","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19364","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ad01ef67b360e9139b8072c8e614b7c7c1f658d2/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0470.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0470","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/45be3b4afd9c4397ee32a5cbf6819a590220b0c1/content/CVE-1999-0470.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1d279cde1e5f7d9e150ca373126c9b35476ad3f5/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0470.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/18de81c56daca1c9e33223f0b95bdb8312a1ca75/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-rr53-vc42-qhx6/GHSA-rr53-vc42-qhx6.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0470.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_2.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--f7322e0d-34c4-49a4-86f9-c1810a42d414.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0134.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0132","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0132.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0468","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Internet Explorer 5.0 的 Microsoft Scriptlet 组件存在信息泄露漏洞，远程攻击者可诱导用户访问恶意网页，利用该组件绕过浏览器安全限制，读取客户端文件系统中的任意文件内容。该漏洞影响 Windows 平台上安装的 IE 5.0 版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可实施攻击，危害等级高，可能导致敏感信息（如本地文件内容）被窃取。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0468"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-04-09T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:27Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS99-012 提供的 MSHTML.DLL 更新补丁，将 Internet Explorer 升级至已修复版本。该补丁通过更新 MSHTML 解析引擎阻止恶意脚本自动粘贴文件名到文件上传控件，防止文件被未经用户确认即提交至远程服务器。如无法安装补丁，可禁用 ActiveX 控件和脚本功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/1999/ms99-012","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ad01ef67b360e9139b8072c8e614b7c7c1f658d2/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0468.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0468","h