ME 账户对 CGI 目录的执行权限。建议替换为其他仍在维护的开源留言本或使用无文件写入的第三方评论服务（如 Disqus）以彻底消除风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["https://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=92368828704896&w=2","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1421f0a4349d5d46275cadd9c7c62349edf9c8bb/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0287.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0287","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-redhat/blob/601a95d57be2a57306cd88389c2251f34b2fbcc1/csaf-vex/1999/cve-1999-0287.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/9074597bd191efd66c2a6bf1f5d8e60bc4801a90/content/CVE-1999-0287.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2f876a2c24d5ccd5bbd081f09e801e580536456a/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0287.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/d21eb36f6164170df89822577def7df5351966d2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0287.json","https://github.com/magicsword-io/Magic-SigExplorer/blob/2c28b91b003429a144a687199ee99ebd26f1a343/Magic-SigExplorer/docs/cve_report.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153400_153500.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0019.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1007","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1007.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1196","title":"Hummingbird Exceed 5.0 远程拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Hummingbird Exceed 5.0 X Window 服务器存在输入验证缺陷，远程攻击者可通过向 TCP 端口 6000 发送特制的畸形数据，触发服务端解析异常，导致 X 服务进程崩溃或资源耗尽，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Hummingbird Exceed 5.0 版本，攻击无需认证，仅需网络可达即可实施。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1196"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-04-07T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:55Z","remediation":"将 Hummingbird Exceed 从 5.0 版本升级至 6.0.1、6.0.2 或 6.1 版本以修复该拒绝服务漏洞。如无法立即升级，可在防火墙或主机层面限制对 TCP 端口 6000（X11 服务端口）的外部访问，仅允许可信 IP 连接，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/13451","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/158","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e8d44fc9434dcaf08511a3267e0bf049a6756de/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1196.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1196","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1196.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f9199c6ea2112c9d2536a126688b640a45f0982a/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1196.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/4544d3857250fe21711ce8febf38e8822729678f/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-g5v2-hv74-hhp6/GHSA-g5v2-hv74-hhp6.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/R/random_crap_DoS.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/1999.tsv","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1196.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000601.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--42baa4ee-b6bc-4f5a-9835-e12a18e09f85.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1007.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0139","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0139.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0473","title":"Rsync rsync 目录权限非预期修改漏洞","description":"rsync 2.3.1 之前版本存在权限处理缺陷，在文件传输过程中服务端目录权限可能被错误地应用到客户端工作目录。攻击者可通过构造特定权限的共享目录，诱使客户端执行 rsync 同步操作后，导致客户端工作目录的权限被非预期修改，可能造成信息泄露或权限提升。该漏洞影响广泛使用的 rsync 工具各早期版本，建议升级至 2.3.1 及以上版本修复。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0473"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-04-07T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:28Z","remediation":"升级 rsync 至 2.3.1 或更高版本，该版本修复了同步过程中权限被意外修改的问题。如无法升级，避免在不受信任的目录上执行 rsync 拉取操作，并在传输后手动检查并重置工作目录权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/145"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0139.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0138","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0138.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0472","title":"NetApp NetCache SNMP 默认团体名安全绕过漏洞","description":"NetApp C630 Netcache 设备中存在 SNMP 默认团体字符串安全配置漏洞。管理员尝试禁用默认的 \"public\" 团体字符串后，该字符串仍未被正确移除，导致攻击者可通过 SNMP 协议利用默认团体字符串远程访问设备，获取系统敏感信息。该漏洞影响 NetApp C630 Netcache 设备，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。建议管理员手动确认并彻底删除默认团体字符串配置。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0472"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-04-07T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:28Z","remediation":"立即检查 NetApp NetCache C630 设备上的 SNMP 配置，确认默认 community string \"public\" 是否已被禁用或修改为自定义复杂字符串。由于该产品已停止支持且无官方补丁，建议在设备 ACL 中限制 SNMP（UDP 161/162）仅允许受信任管理 IP 访问，或直接禁用 SNMP 服务。对于仍在运行的旧设备，应尽快迁移至受支持的替代产品。在 Brocade 等后续受影响产品中，升级至厂商确认不受影响的固件版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0472","https://www.broadcom.com/support/fibre-channel-networking/security-advisories/brocade-security-advisory-2017-240","https://www.broadcom.com/support/fibre-channel-networking/security-advisories/brocade-security-advisory-2017-240/"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0138.toml"}]